.com/2026/11/25/us/economic-growth-recession-pessimism.html'&gt;美国并未陷入衰退。尝试告诉许多美国人这一点。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The U.S. Isn’t in a Recession. Try Telling Many Americans That.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/economic-growth-recession-pessimism.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:06:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>通胀坚挺支撑美联储再次加息计划</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/economy/inflation-pce-interest-rates.html</link><description>人们普遍预计美联储将在下个月加息。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/economy/inflation-pce-interest-rates.html'&gt;通胀坚挺支撑美联储再次加息计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Another Hot Inflation Reading Keeps Fed on Track to Raise Rates Again&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/economy/inflation-pce-interest-rates.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:21:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普政府以不公平做法为由对数十个国家征收新关税</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html</link><description>最近的事态升级之际，政府面临着持续的法律障碍和即将上任的民主党领导的国会的新审查。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html'&gt;特朗普政府以不公平做法为由对数十个国家征收新关税&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Administration Unveils New Tariffs for China, EU and More, Citing Unfair Practices&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:58:36 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>